nity unit until labor begins spontaneously.\n(Option B) Transferring the patient to a tertiary hospital is recommended for women with PROM before 37 weeks if labor is not imminent and prematurity is a concern, in which case\noptimal care for the premature baby in a neonatal intensive care unit (NICU) will be of paramount importance.\n(Option C) Tocolysis is not indicated because the fetus is mature. If labor starts it should not be stopped.\n(Option D) At 39 weeks the fetal lung maturity has already has completed; therefore, corticosteroids are not indicated.\n(Option E) Admission and observation for the labor to begin and progress may be considered if the patient prefers expectant management and there are no contraindications. This,\nhowever, should not delay antibiotic coverage for GBS, when the PROM has lasted more than 18 hours. IOB of labor should not be delayed beyond 24 hours.\nNOTE – In patients with positive undetermined GBS status, antibiotic coverage against GBS is always indicated regardless of the duration of PROM and should be administered as\nsoon as possible.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","antibiotic","duration","management","pregnan"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"very_high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"20241e07c8cafc94bcb825a727cd52be430b8d49","duplicate_group_id":"exact-20241e07c8ca","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"52f612786b8a878bf2d1","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":979,"source_qid":"986"}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
