years of cessation, will be the same as that of women who have never used COCs. Generally, the benefits of preventing unwanted pregnancy and its harms outweighs the slightly
increased risk of breast cancer associated with COCs.
In consulting Hanna, she should be told the main concern would be the increased risk of cervical cancer if COCs are taken longer than 5 years as the main concern, and the fact that
there is a just slightly increased risk of breast cancer according to studies. COCs would not be appropriate for her in the presence of any personal history of breast cancer but even
with breast cancer history in her first degree relatives, she can still take COCs.
It should be explained to her than in fact OCPs decrease her risk of developing ovarian, endometrial and colon cancers.',NULL,'Retain the source-era answer for question-bank study; verify current Australian guidance before clinical use.',NULL,NULL,'2023','v2.9.4',1,'text','{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"1455","duplicate_group_id":"exact-1dd5077507ee","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"a0ea1df6e9c38df9aacc","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":1012,"source_qid":"1455"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET source_id=excluded.source_id,source_question_no=excluded.source_question_no,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,system=excluded.system,topic=excluded.topic,clinical_task=excluded.clinical_task,stem_en=excluded.stem_en,answer_key=excluded.answer_key,source_explanation_en=excluded.source_explanation_en,memory_rule_en=excluded.memory_rule_en,image_ref=excluded.image_ref,source_year=excluded.source_year,import_version=excluded.import_version,active=1,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk;
