s, coughing, straining, etc.) DRA often develops around the umbilicus\nbut can also occur anywhere between the xiphoid and the pubic bone. DRA can happen in varying degrees in pregnancy due to abdominal musculature stretch weakness from\nmaternal hormonal changes and increased tension by the growing uterus. DRA presents as a painless midline swelling which increases in size and accentuates with increased\nabdominal pressure such as with coughing. The presence of tenderness and its locations in this scenario (RLQ) make DRA less likely of a diagnosis.\nPlacenta previa (option D) and vasa previa (option E) could present with painless vaginal bleeding. CTG usually shows compromised fetal parameters. With abdominal pain and\nnormal CTG, these are less likely to be the cause of such presentation.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","anticoag","pregnan","therapy"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"very_high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"a88509163ec2244b3440af79eae0344fb246de9a","duplicate_group_id":"exact-a88509163ec2","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"bd81d37041a8ba9af70f","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":1028,"source_qid":"1702"}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
