(Option D) Full blood count helps to determine the degree of blood loss and in guiding fluid resuscitation or blood transfusion. It is not diagnostic.
(Option E) Urine beta hCG is the very first diagnostic test when ectopic pregnancy is suspected. With most current pregnancy test kits (sensitive for as little as 25 units per litre) urine may reveal results 3-4 days after implantation; by 7 days (the time
of expected period) 98% will be positive. With an ectopic pregnancy a urine beta hCG may be falsely negative in more than 50% of women in early pregnancy; however, at 6 weeks it will be positive in as many as 99% of women, and a negative urine
test can safely exclude the ectopic pregnancy.
Another very important test to consider without delay in this situation (not mentioned here) is blood group typing and cross matching, as this patient may need blood transfusion.',NULL,'Retain the source-era answer for question-bank study; verify current Australian guidance before clinical use.',NULL,NULL,'2023','v2.9.4',1,'text','{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-8999e5bdf8aa","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"602c23f7762570bd1a36","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":1054,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','high') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET source_id=excluded.source_id,source_question_no=excluded.source_question_no,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,system=excluded.system,topic=excluded.topic,clinical_task=excluded.clinical_task,stem_en=excluded.stem_en,answer_key=excluded.answer_key,source_explanation_en=excluded.source_explanation_en,memory_rule_en=excluded.memory_rule_en,image_ref=excluded.image_ref,source_year=excluded.source_year,import_version=excluded.import_version,active=1,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk;
