This girl has regular menstruation. Her blood pressure is also normal. These two, make Cushing’s syndrome less likely; therefore, serum ACTH (option E) and urinary or plasma cortisol levels (option A) are not likely to be abnormal. The striae can be
caused by obesity and overstretching of the abdominal wall.
Fatigue can also be a feature seen in thyroid hormone problems. Although hypothyroidism has fatigue and obesity as its clinical features, the presence of acanthosis nigricans makes this diagnosis less likely; therefore, THS measurement (option C)
probably will not add a diagnostic benefit. 
Metabolic syndrome is seen in 25% of patients with PCOS. In patients with PCOS, ultrasonography can show multiple ovarian cysts. PCOS is associated with menstruation abnormalities and is the most common cause of anovulatory cycles and
infertility in women. With regular periods, this girl is unlikely to have PCOS, and ultrasound (option D) is unlikely to be helpful.',NULL,'Retain the source-era answer for question-bank study; verify current Australian guidance before clinical use.',NULL,NULL,'2023','v2.9.4',1,'text','{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"1070","duplicate_group_id":"exact-2593c56b1589","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"b83a6baf75fb07c91a98","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":1059,"source_qid":"1070"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET source_id=excluded.source_id,source_question_no=excluded.source_question_no,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,system=excluded.system,topic=excluded.topic,clinical_task=excluded.clinical_task,stem_en=excluded.stem_en,answer_key=excluded.answer_key,source_explanation_en=excluded.source_explanation_en,memory_rule_en=excluded.memory_rule_en,image_ref=excluded.image_ref,source_year=excluded.source_year,import_version=excluded.import_version,active=1,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk;
