Dysmenorrhea (moderate to severe) – 60 to 80% of cases
Chronic pelvic pain – 40-50% of cases
Dysuria and hematuria – 5% of cases
Infertility – 30 to 50% of cases
Deep dyspareunia – 40 to 50% of cases
Dyschezia, tenesmus, and painful abdominal bloating - 10 to 40% of cases
Premenstrual spotting lasting 1-2 days
Heavy menstrual bleeding – 10-20%
Dysmenorrhea has been by far the most common symptoms in patients with endometriosis.','{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"330","duplicate_group_id":"exact-0c3f1c08b9a1","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"08d53527b396979d09cb","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":1092,"source_qid":"330"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"08d53527b396979d09cb","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_year":2023,"source_page":1092,"source_qid":"330","domain_hint":"Mixed/Unclassified","stem":"Which one of the following is the most common symptom of endometriosis?","options":{"A":"Dysmenorrhea.","B":"Dysuria.","C":"Infertility.","D":"Deep dyspareunia.","E":"Painful abdominal bloating."},"source_answer":"A","source_explanation":"Endometriosis can presents with the following features:\nDysmenorrhea (moderate to severe) – 60 to 80% of cases\nChronic pelvic pain – 40-50% of cases\nDysuria and hematuria – 5% of cases\nInfertility – 30 to 50% of cases\nDeep dyspareunia – 40 to 50% of cases\nDyschezia, tenesmus, and painful abdominal bloating - 10 to 40% of cases\nPremenstrual spotting lasting 1-2 days\nHeavy menstrual bleeding – 10-20%\nDysmenorrhea has been by far the most common symptoms in patients with endometriosis.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"low","currentness_keywords":[],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"very_high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser